# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Regenerated by `flutter gen-l10n` (see l10n.yaml) — the untranslated-key
# backlog, not a build input.
/l10n_untranslated.json

# Golden-diff output `flutter test` writes when an image comparison fails —
# the actual/expected/isolated PNGs, regenerated on every failing run.
/test/failures/

# Bulk raw captures. Regenerated on demand by the conversion tooling, and
# large — a run writes a PNG per screen per viewport per theme per language.
#
# What IS committed, deliberately: the golden baselines the tests need, the
# component measurements the parity tests read, and the comparison reports.
# Those are the durable evidence; the raw pixels are reproducible from them.
/docs/conversion_archive/shots/

